olor:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;data:image/png;[base64 data]&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;width&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#066\">400</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;height&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#066\">400</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;coordmap&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:[{</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;domain&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:{</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;left&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:-</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.04</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;right&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1.04</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;bottom&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:-</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.04</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;top&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1.04</span><span style=\"color:#660\">},</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;range&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:{</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;left&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;right&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#066\">400</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;bottom&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#066\">399</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;top&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:-</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">},</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;log&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:{</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;x&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#008\">null</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;y&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#008\">null</span><span style=\"color:#660\">},</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;mapping&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:{}}]}},</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;inputMessages&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:[{</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;id&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;indLabelName&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;message&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:{</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;options&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;&lt;option value=\\&quot;Line Graph\\&quot;&gt;Line Graph&lt;/option&gt;&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">}}]}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>RECV </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;method&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;update&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;data&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:{</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;indLabelName&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Line Graph&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;.clientdata_output_ggPlot_height&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#066\">400</span><span style=\"color:#660\">}}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>SEND </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;errors&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:[],</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;values&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:[],</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;inputMessages&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:[{</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;id&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;textTitle&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;message&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:{</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;value&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">}},{</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;id&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;textX&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;message&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:{</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;value&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">}},{</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;id&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;textY&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;message&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:{</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;value&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">}},{</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;id&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;textZ&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;message&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:{</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;value&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">}},{</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;id&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;textLegend&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;message&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:{</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;value&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">}},{</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;id&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;legPos&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;message&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:{</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;value&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;right&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">}}]}</span></div></code></div><div><br></div></div></code></div><div><br></div>But the trace isn&#39;t actually performing any recursions. There isn&#39;t even a large amount of text being dumped to the console. Maybe it isn&#39;t a true recursion? However, if I debug my program so that it is paused at renderPlot()  I keep hitting the same breakpoint over and over again. Maybe it is a bad call stack?<div><div><br></div><div>The issue does not persist if I change runApp options to &#39;external&#39;. This opens the window in chrome automatically. However, the issue is occurring if the runApp option is set to &#39;Run in Window&#39;. When the R Studio window opens and I choose the &quot;Open in Browser&quot; option the issues begin to occur once more. I will be testing my program on a different computer this afternoon to see if it is the code itself or the studio.  <div><br></div><div>As for software I have the latest Chrome, R 3.2.1, Shiny 0.12.1. </div></div></div></div><div><br></div><div>Thanks for your help!</div><div><br></div><div>Amber</div></div></div>"
