   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">As an update, I pulled the old version of my application and added my updates to that. I made my changes 1 by 1 to check the run time issues. Then, finally, I found the supposed little bugger. The issue seems to have stemmed from my global class. When I was performing code clean up I decided to put my reactiveValues into the global.R file so that the server only contained observe and observeEvent functions. Once I moved this back to the server itself the issues went away. HUZZAH!<div><br></div><div>Sorry about all the confusion. :D Thank you for the assistance.</div></div>"
    ]
   ]
